it-curl.mdx","Todas las peticiones de una actualización completa en modo hawkBit, incluido el lado del dispositivo por DDI, con respuestas reales.",{"_123":457},"platform/updates/guides/hawkbit-curl.mdx",{"_99":459,"_106":144,"_119":-7,"_101":460},"es:_10","Referencia",{"_99":462,"_106":116,"_101":76,"_110":463,"_119":-7,"_13":75,"_121":464},"es:platform/updates/reference/api.mdx","Todas las rutas de las APIs HTTP de Lamassu Updates y SymKMS, con cuerpos de petición, códigos de estado y comportamiento por backend.",{"_123":465},"platform/updates/reference/api.mdx",{"_99":467,"_106":116,"_101":79,"_110":468,"_119":-7,"_13":78,"_121":469},"es:platform/updates/reference/capabilities.mdx","Las 22 capacidades de Lamassu Updates, qué admite cada backend y cómo las lee un cliente.",{"_123":470},"platform/updates/reference/capabilities.mdx",{"_99":472,"_106":116,"_101":82,"_110":473,"_119":-7,"_13":81,"_121":474},"es:platform/updates/reference/configuration.mdx","Todas las claves de configuración de Lamassu Updates, su valor por defecto, qué backend las lee y cómo sobrescribirlas con variables de entorno.",{"_123":475},"platform/updates/reference/configuration.mdx",{"_99":477,"_106":144,"_119":-7,"_101":478},"es:_11","Operación",{"_99":480,"_106":116,"_101":70,"_110":481,"_119":-7,"_13":69,"_121":482},"es:platform/updates/operations.mdx","Despliega Lamassu Updates con Docker Compose o Helm, escálalo, dimensiónalo, obsérvalo, haz copias de seguridad y actualízalo.",{"_123":483},"platform/updates/operations.mdx",{"_99":485,"_106":116,"_101":85,"_110":486,"_119":-7,"_13":84,"_121":487},"es:platform/updates/security.mdx","Qué protege y qué no protege Lamassu Updates, y qué poner a su alrededor antes de exponerlo.",{"_123":488},"platform/updates/security.mdx",{"_99":490,"_106":116,"_101":91,"_110":491,"_119":-7,"_13":90,"_121":492},"es:platform/updates/troubleshooting.mdx","Síntomas, causas probables y soluciones para errores de arranque, llamadas a la API, construcciones, desca